# Documents are not published: the public repository carries CODE ONLY.
# The design documents, the two course task templates and the course variable
# list stay on this machine. Every test that reads one of them skips cleanly
# when it is absent, so a fresh clone still runs all four gates green.
#
# Note: .gitignore does not untrack files that are already tracked, so the
# documents keep their local version history — this only stops new ones from
# being picked up by `git add -A`, and marks the intent for the public tree.
docs/
Gruppe_A_Aufgabe_SS2026.txt
Gruppe_B_Aufgabe_SS2026.txt
Variablenliste.txt

